{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/lhama_clicker_titulo_da_pagina_.png?t=1746126029\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/ABOUT_THE_GAME_600X.png?t=1746126029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lhama Clicker</strong> is an idle clicker game about <strong>reproducing</strong> an <strong>infinite</strong> number of llamas. To increase your production to <strong>ridiculous levels</strong>, you will need to buy upgrades, level up, buy <strong>astral upgrades</strong>, and <strong>rebirth</strong> many times to become <strong>faster and more powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along this adventure, you will <strong>also</strong> unlock cosmetics such as llama skins, beautiful hats, and new backgrounds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/descricoes.png?t=1746126029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/22222r.gif?t=1746126029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/pagina_loja_texto__1_.png?t=1746126029\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/skins_pagin_a_da_loja_600xp_.png?t=1746126029\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/all_upgra4des_.png?t=1746126029\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/extras/upgradess__1_.png?t=1746126029\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285390/e